{"seq":4,"slug":"memory-model-and-jmm","title":"Java 内存模型与 JMM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/java-language/jvm-internals/memory-model-and-jmm","wordCount":1072,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"java-内存模型与-jmm\">Java 内存模型与 JMM</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Java 内存模型（Java Memory Model, JMM）定义了多线程程序中变量的访问规则——即一个线程对共享变量的写入何时对另一个线程可见。JMM 是 Java 并发编程的理论基础，它通过 happens-before 关系来描述操作之间的可见性和有序性保证，屏蔽了不同硬件平台内存一致性模型的差异。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[线程 1] --&gt; B[工作内存 1]&#10;    C[线程 2] --&gt; D[工作内存 2]&#10;    B &lt;--&gt;|read/write| E[主内存]&#10;    D &lt;--&gt;|read/write| E&#10;    B -.-&gt;|缓存副本| F[变量 x 的副本]&#10;    D -.-&gt;|缓存副本| G[变量 x 的副本]&#10;    E --&gt; H[变量 x 的主副本]\">graph TD\n    A[线程 1] --&gt; B[工作内存 1]\n    C[线程 2] --&gt; D[工作内存 2]\n    B &lt;--&gt;|read/write| E[主内存]\n    D &lt;--&gt;|read/write| E\n    B -.-&gt;|缓存副本| F[变量 x 的副本]\n    D -.-&gt;|缓存副本| G[变量 x 的副本]\n    E --&gt; H[变量 x 的主副本]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>关键点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主内存</td>\n<td>所有线程共享的内存区域</td>\n<td>对应堆中的对象字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工作内存</td>\n<td>线程私有的内存副本</td>\n<td>对应 CPU 缓存/寄存器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可见性</td>\n<td>一个线程的修改对其他线程可见</td>\n<td>需要特定同步手段保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有序性</td>\n<td>代码执行顺序的保证</td>\n<td>编译器和 CPU 会重排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原子性</td>\n<td>操作不可被中断</td>\n<td>long/double 的非原子性读写</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>JMM 是一个抽象模型，不直接对应硬件架构。它的核心是定义了一组规则，告诉编译器和 CPU 哪些重排序是允许的，哪些必须被禁止。</p>\n<h2 id=\"happens-before-规则\">Happens-Before 规则</h2><p>Happens-before 是 JMM 的核心概念——如果操作 A happens-before 操作 B，则 A 的结果对 B 可见，且 A 在逻辑上排在 B 之前。JMM 定义了以下 happens-before 规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 规则1：程序顺序规则&#10;// 同一线程中，前面的操作 happens-before 后面的操作&#10;int a = 1;    // (1)&#10;int b = a;    // (2) → (1) happens-before (2)&#10;&#10;// 规则2：监视器锁规则&#10;// 解锁 happens-before 后续对同一锁的加锁&#10;synchronized (lock) {&#10;    x = 1;    // (1) 写入 x&#10;}             // (2) 解锁&#10;// 另一线程&#10;synchronized (lock) {   // (3) 加锁 → (2) happens-before (3)&#10;    int r = x;          // (4) 保证读到 x = 1&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 规则3：volatile 变量规则&#10;// 对 volatile 变量的写 happens-before 后续对该变量的读&#10;volatile boolean flag = false;&#10;// 线程 A&#10;x = 42;        // (1)&#10;flag = true;   // (2) volatile 写&#10;&#10;// 线程 B&#10;if (flag) {    // (3) volatile 读 → (2) happens-before (3)&#10;    int r = x; // (4) 保证读到 x = 42&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 规则1：程序顺序规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 同一线程中，前面的操作 happens-before 后面的操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// (1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a;    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// (2) → (1) happens-before (2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 规则2：监视器锁规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 解锁 happens-before 后续对同一锁的加锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">synchronized</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (lock) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// (1) 写入 x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// (2) 解锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 另一线程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">synchronized</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (lock) {   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// (3) 加锁 → (2) happens-before (3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x;          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// (4) 保证读到 x = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 规则3：volatile 变量规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 对 volatile 变量的写 happens-before 后续对该变量的读</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">volatile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 线程 A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// (1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">flag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// (2) volatile 写</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 线程 B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (flag) {    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// (3) volatile 读 → (2) happens-before (3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// (4) 保证读到 x = 42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>完整的 happens-before 规则列表</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>传递性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>程序顺序规则</td>\n<td>同一线程内，前面的操作 HB 后面的</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监视器锁规则</td>\n<td>unlock HB 后续同一锁的 lock</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>volatile 规则</td>\n<td>volatile 写 HB 后续的 volatile 读</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程启动规则</td>\n<td>Thread.start() HB 被启动线程的任何操作</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程终止规则</td>\n<td>线程的所有操作 HB Thread.join() 返回</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中断规则</td>\n<td>interrupt() 调用 HB 被中断线程检测到中断</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终结器规则</td>\n<td>构造函数结束 HB finalize() 开始</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传递性规则</td>\n<td>如果 A HB B, B HB C，则 A HB C</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"volatile-语义与内存屏障\">volatile 语义与内存屏障</h2><p>volatile 关键字提供了两个保证：可见性（写入立即刷新到主内存，读取从主内存加载）和有序性（禁止 volatile 读写前后的特定重排序）。但 volatile 不保证原子性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"public class DoubleCheckSingleton {&#10;    private static volatile DoubleCheckSingleton instance;&#10;&#10;    public static DoubleCheckSingleton getInstance() {&#10;        if (instance == null) {                    // 第一次检查（无锁）&#10;            synchronized (DoubleCheckSingleton.class) {&#10;                if (instance == null) {            // 第二次检查（有锁）&#10;                    instance = new DoubleCheckSingleton();&#10;                    // 没有 volatile，这行可能被重排序为：&#10;                    // 1. 分配内存&#10;                    // 2. 将引用赋值给 instance（此时对象未初始化！）&#10;                    // 3. 执行构造函数&#10;                    // volatile 禁止了 2 和 3 的重排序&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        return instance;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DoubleCheckSingleton</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> volatile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DoubleCheckSingleton instance;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DoubleCheckSingleton </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getInstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (instance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 第一次检查（无锁）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            synchronized</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (DoubleCheckSingleton.class) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (instance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 第二次检查（有锁）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    instance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DoubleCheckSingleton</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    // 没有 volatile，这行可能被重排序为：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    // 1. 分配内存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    // 2. 将引用赋值给 instance（此时对象未初始化！）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    // 3. 执行构造函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    // volatile 禁止了 2 和 3 的重排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instance;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>volatile 的内存屏障实现</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// volatile 写操作前插入 StoreStore 屏障&#10;// volatile 写操作后插入 StoreLoad 屏障（最重的屏障）&#10;// volatile 读操作后插入 LoadLoad + LoadStore 屏障&#10;&#10;// 在 x86 架构上：&#10;// volatile 写 → lock 前缀指令（或 mfence）&#10;// volatile 读 → 无需额外指令（x86 天然保证 Load-Load 和 Load-Store 顺序）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// volatile 写操作前插入 StoreStore 屏障</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// volatile 写操作后插入 StoreLoad 屏障（最重的屏障）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// volatile 读操作后插入 LoadLoad + LoadStore 屏障</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在 x86 架构上：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// volatile 写 → lock 前缀指令（或 mfence）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// volatile 读 → 无需额外指令（x86 天然保证 Load-Load 和 Load-Store 顺序）</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>重排序场景</th>\n<th>是否允许</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>普通读 → volatile 读</td>\n<td>允许</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>volatile 读 → 普通读/写</td>\n<td>禁止</td>\n<td>LoadLoad + LoadStore</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>普通写 → volatile 写</td>\n<td>禁止</td>\n<td>StoreStore</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>volatile 写 → 普通读/写</td>\n<td>禁止</td>\n<td>StoreLoad</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>volatile 写 → volatile 读</td>\n<td>禁止</td>\n<td>StoreLoad</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"final-语义与安全发布\">final 语义与安全发布</h2><p>JMM 对 final 字段提供了特殊的初始化安全保证：在构造函数中写入 final 字段，在构造函数完成后，任何线程都能看到正确初始化的 final 字段值——即使对象的引用没有使用 volatile 或同步。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"public class ImmutableConfig {&#10;    private final Map&lt;String, String&gt; settings;&#10;&#10;    public ImmutableConfig(Map&lt;String, String&gt; src) {&#10;        this.settings = Collections.unmodifiableMap(new HashMap&lt;&gt;(src));&#10;        // JMM 保证：构造函数结束后，任何线程读到 settings 字段&#10;        // 都能看到完整初始化的 HashMap 内容&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public String get(String key) {&#10;        return settings.get(key);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ImmutableConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Map&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> settings;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ImmutableConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Map&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">src</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.settings </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Collections.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unmodifiableMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HashMap&#x3C;>(src));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // JMM 保证：构造函数结束后，任何线程读到 settings 字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 都能看到完整初始化的 HashMap 内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> String </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(String </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> settings.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>但有一个前提条件</strong>——对象引用不能在构造函数完成之前泄漏（this 逃逸）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"public class Broken {&#10;    private final int value;&#10;&#10;    public Broken(int v) {&#10;        // 危险：在构造函数完成前发布 this&#10;        GlobalRegistry.register(this);  // 其他线程可能看到 value = 0&#10;        this.value = v;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Broken</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Broken</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 危险：在构造函数完成前发布 this</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        GlobalRegistry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 其他线程可能看到 value = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>安全发布对象的方式</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>volatile 引用</td>\n<td>volatile 写屏障</td>\n<td>延迟初始化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>synchronized 保护</td>\n<td>监视器锁规则</td>\n<td>需要互斥的场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>final 字段</td>\n<td>final 语义保证</td>\n<td>不可变对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Atomic 引用</td>\n<td>CAS + volatile</td>\n<td>无锁数据结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态初始化器</td>\n<td>类加载保证</td>\n<td>单例/常量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"常见并发可见性问题\">常见并发可见性问题</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 问题1：无限循环——缺少可见性保证&#10;public class StopThread {&#10;    private boolean stopped = false;  // 应该用 volatile&#10;&#10;    public void run() {&#10;        while (!stopped) {&#10;            // JIT 可能将 stopped 提升到循环外（hoisting）&#10;            // 导致永远看不到 stopped = true&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void stop() { stopped = true; }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 问题2：volatile 不保证原子性&#10;public class Counter {&#10;    private volatile int count = 0;&#10;&#10;    public void increment() {&#10;        count++;  // 非原子操作：read → increment → write&#10;        // 多线程下仍然会丢失更新&#10;        // 应使用 AtomicInteger 或 synchronized&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 问题3：long/double 的非原子性&#10;// JMM 不保证 64 位类型的原子读写（32 位 JVM 上）&#10;private long timestamp;  // 应该用 volatile long\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 问题1：无限循环——缺少可见性保证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StopThread</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stopped </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 应该用 volatile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stopped) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // JIT 可能将 stopped 提升到循环外（hoisting）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // 导致永远看不到 stopped = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> stop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() { stopped </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 问题2：volatile 不保证原子性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Counter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> volatile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 非原子操作：read → increment → write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 多线程下仍然会丢失更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 应使用 AtomicInteger 或 synchronized</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 问题3：long/double 的非原子性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// JMM 不保证 64 位类型的原子读写（32 位 JVM 上）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timestamp;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 应该用 volatile long</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>循环不终止</td>\n<td>可见性缺失</td>\n<td>volatile / synchronized</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计数器丢失更新</td>\n<td>volatile 不保证原子性</td>\n<td>AtomicInteger / synchronized</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读到部分写入值</td>\n<td>long/double 非原子</td>\n<td>volatile / Atomic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象未完全构造</td>\n<td>this 逃逸</td>\n<td>不在构造函数中泄漏 this</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指令重排序</td>\n<td>编译器/CPU 优化</td>\n<td>volatile / synchronized</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>JMM 定义了多线程程序中共享变量的可见性和有序性规则，是 Java 并发的理论基础</li>\n<li>Happens-before 是判断操作间可见性的核心工具，八大规则加传递性覆盖所有同步场景</li>\n<li>volatile 保证可见性和有序性但不保证原子性，底层通过内存屏障禁止特定重排序</li>\n<li>双重检查锁定必须使用 volatile 防止对象引用的重排序问题</li>\n<li>final 字段在构造函数完成后具有初始化安全保证，前提是 this 不在构造期间泄漏</li>\n<li>安全发布对象的方式：volatile 引用、synchronized、final 字段、Atomic 引用、静态初始化器</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Java 内存模型与 JMM","id":"java-内存模型与-jmm"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Happens-Before 规则","id":"happens-before-规则"},{"level":2,"text":"volatile 语义与内存屏障","id":"volatile-语义与内存屏障"},{"level":2,"text":"final 语义与安全发布","id":"final-语义与安全发布"},{"level":2,"text":"常见并发可见性问题","id":"常见并发可见性问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"垃圾回收算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/java-language/jvm-internals/garbage-collection-algorithms"},"next":{"title":"java.util.concurrent 核心组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/java-language/concurrency-in-depth/java-util-concurrent"}}